---
description: Mandatory security and verification controls
alwaysApply: true
---

Evaluate authentication, authorization, organization isolation, RLS, Storage,
service-role use, validation, data exposure, idempotency, transaction safety,
audit, secrets and immutability for every change.

Use VERIFIED, IMPLEMENTED, PARTIAL, NOT RUN, UNVERIFIED, BLOCKED or FAILED
precisely. Never report PASS without execution. Missing external infrastructure
blocks only its dependent runtime verification, not unrelated implementation.
